OL,3,GNEWSATwo injured after police dogs
OL,4,Aescape handler's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people were injured when two police
OL,7,Fdogs escaped from their handler's home
OL,8,Fin Leicestershire.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said the dogs -
OL,11,Fone "currently operational" with the
OL,12,Fother retired - got out of the garden
OL,13,Fof the address in Sileby on Tuesday.
OL,15,FTwo members of the public sustained
OL,16,Fminor injuries that did not require
OL,17,Fmedical attention, the force said, and
OL,18,Fthe dogs were brought under control by
OL,19,Fthe officers living at the address and
OL,20,Ftaken back to the house.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
