OL,3,GNEWSATwo injured after police dogs
OL,4,Aescape handler's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said the incident was reported
OL,7,Fto the force, and after a "thorough"
OL,8,Finvestigation, officers determined that
OL,9,Fthe "correct security arrangements are
OL,10,Fusually in place, and this was an
OL,11,Fisolated incident".
